# --- cargo-fuzz local caches ---
# Discovered-corpus and failing-input directories are populated by
# `cargo fuzz run` on each developer's machine. CI uploads the
# `artifacts/` directory on failure, so reproducers don't get lost.
fuzz/corpus/
fuzz/artifacts/
fuzz/coverage/

